{{also|semăna}}
==Classical Nahuatl==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|es|nci}} {{m|es|semana}}, from {{etyl|la|nci}} {{m|la|septimana}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ʃiˈmaː.naʔ]|lang=nci}}

===Noun===
{{nci-noun|i}}

# [[week|Week]].
#* '''17C:''' [[w:Bernardino de Sahagún|Bernardino de Sahagún]], [[w:Chimalpahin|Chimalpahin]], ''[[w:Exercicio quotidiano|Exercicio quotidiano]]'', f. 1r.
#*: tlaxexelolli yn ipan cecemilhuitl ynic ontlanj. ce '''semana'''.
#*: (divided into each of the days with which a week is completed.)

===References===
* {{reference-book|author=Chimalpahin Quauhtlehuanitzin, Domingo Francisco de San Antón Muñón|year=1997|others=ed. and trans. by Arthur J. O. Anderson and Susan Schroeder|title=Codex Chimalpahin, Volume 2|pages=pp. 130–131|id=ISBN 0-8061-2950-6}}

